<?xml version="1.0"?>
<package>
	<metadata>
		<id>ImranAkram.XTB.AutoDeployer</id>
		<version>1.0.0</version>
		<title>Auto Deployer Tool for XrmToolBox</title>
		<authors>Imran Akram, Jonas Rapp, Oleksii Shytikov</authors>
		<owners>imranakram, rappen, biznamics</owners>
		<projectUrl>https://github.com/ImranAkram/XrmToolBox.AutoDeployer</projectUrl>
		<icon>icon.png</icon>
		<readme>docs\README.md</readme>
		<requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
		<description>Tool to automatically upload plugin assemblies and web resources if they are changed during build process.</description>
		<summary>Tool to automatically upload plugin assemblies and web resources if they are changed during build process.</summary>
		<releaseNotes>
New
- Project files (#19, thanks Jonas Rapp): Save... writes the watched plugin assemblies, plugin packages and web resources (with their root folder and mappings) to an .adproj file. Open... loads it again, later or on another connection, and asks whether to keep or replace the current watchers.
- Watched plugin assemblies are remembered per connection and come back when you reconnect, like plugin packages and web resources already did.
- Plugin packages: when the saved package id doesn't exist in the connected environment, the package is looked up by name and the upload is retried.

Fixes
- Replacing the watchers when opening a project now really stops the old ones, instead of leaving them deploying in the background.
- Plugin packages in a project are skipped, with a message, on environments that don't support them (on-premises). Opening a project right after connecting no longer skips them while that check is still running.
- Open... and adding a plugin assembly need a connection first.
- Removing a plugin assembly that wasn't found in Dataverse no longer throws an error, and its file watcher is released.

Behind the scenes
- Built, tested and released with GitHub Actions (#20); AppVeyor config removed.
- Unit tests, plus local integration tests against a Dataverse test environment.
		</releaseNotes>
		<copyright>Copyright 2016-2026 Imran, Jonas, Oleksii</copyright>
		<tags>XrmToolBox Plugins Auto Deployer Tool</tags>
		<dependencies>
			<dependency id="XrmToolBox" version="1.2025.7.71" />
		</dependencies>
	</metadata>
	<files>
		<file src="XrmToolBox.AutoDeployer\bin\Release\ImranAkram.XTB.AutoDeployer.dll" target="lib\net48\Plugins" />
		<file src="icon.png" target="" />
		<file src="README.md" target="docs\" />
	</files>
</package>